Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,miltakeaibou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nen Throne Slash
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.10,0:01:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys, it's Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.56,0:01:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see Ken and the\Nothers getting along better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Cody was invited\Nto his Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what a great present they gave us\Nolder kids by bringing our Digimon back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see they have\Nrespect for their elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While they were at Ken's party, we\Nwent to see Matt's band playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But these digital monsters stole the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one could Digivolve because\Nsomeone put up a control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari and the others\Ncrushed it when we sent
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.14,0:01:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all those monsters back when they belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken knew our Ukkomon was\Nbehind the control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that she's opened\Nup all the DigiPorts,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other Digimon can come\Nand go as they please.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx100\fscy100\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(246,368)}General Mobilization!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx100\fscy100\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(422,407)}Imperialdramon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.94,0:02:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We interrupt the Power Rangers Arbor Day\Nspecial for this special news bulletin.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.52,jogress,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF5F5EE&\fad(400,0)\pos(317,358)}2002/12/25, 8 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange black towers that\Nbegan appearing last night in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.44,0:02:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Odaiba have now begun springing\Nup all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:02:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were first thought to be a\Nmarketing scheme for a dot-com company.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, I've just\Nbeen handed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've just been informed\Nthat large monsters have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now been spotted in the\Nareas of these towers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are advised to lock\Nyour doors and stay inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.02,0:02:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is a list of areas where\Nthe monsters have been spotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hills near Oso.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The area adjacent to the\Nclock tower in Sapporo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clock next to Osaka Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The area next to Tamachi Station in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he say Tamachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The grassy knoll in Dallas, Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Venice Beach in California,\Nalthough no one's going yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.18,0:03:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us are going to\Nmeet over at Izzy's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, Davis?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.08,0:03:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.34,0:03:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now I have to go to Tamachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's Digimon in Tamachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where Ken lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably begging for\Nmy help right now. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.94,0:03:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tamachi isn't the only\Nplace in trouble, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People all over the world need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't worry about one individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's go to Izzy's house and\Ncome up with some sort of a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.09,0:03:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not an individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Davis... You're right. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take charge of\Neverything on this end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go on to Tamachi and\Nhelp out Ken. Ha! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reports continue to come in from around\Nthe world on these giant monster attacks.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.37,0:03:53.37,jogress,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(325,236)}2002/12/24 7PM, Niagara Falls, America
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.37,0:03:53.37,jogress,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(322,435)}(25th 8AM in Japan)
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.37,0:03:56.38,jogress,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(320,236)}2002/12/24 6PM, Nazca, Peru
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.37,0:03:56.38,jogress,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(326,435)}(25th 8AM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our viewers might remember that a\Nsimilar event took place four years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.38,0:03:59.34,jogress shadow,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(320,236)\fscx90\fscy90}2002/12/25 7AM, Nathan Road, Hong Kong
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.38,0:03:59.34,jogress shadow,,0,0,0,,{\be1\pos(324,435)}{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(326,434)}(25th 8AM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:04:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armed forces around the globe are\Ntrying desperately to attack them,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.34,0:04:02.30,jogress,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(323,236)}2002/12/25 9AM, Australian Sea
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.34,0:04:02.30,jogress,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(327,434)}(25th 8AM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.00,0:04:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using the information they\Ngathered in those original battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.10,0:04:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every time they get remotely\Nclose to one of the monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they suffer from extreme\Nequipment failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.12,0:04:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, nothing works.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the world's military community is\Nclaiming that any data stored in their
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,computers from that time have mysteriously\Nvanished from their hard drives
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without a trace stay tuned to this\Nnews station for round-the-clock
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coverage of this unbelievable catastrophe\Nbut first here's johnny with sports
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.42,0:04:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my friend you look a thousand years\Nyounger thank you azulongman amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what a few digivitamins can do i\Nhave something for you a digicore
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.90,0:04:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i think you know what to do with it\Nremember its powers are not to be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taken lightly i'll remember thank\Nyou good luck to you you'll need it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If both worlds ought to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, I'm getting emails\Nfrom kids all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, talk about deja vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're not just kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're Digidestined kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's over 200 emails already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me we're not the only\NDigidestined going around saving the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm not exactly\Nsure how many Digidestined exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm guessing any kid who's\Never seen a Digimon qualifies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.18,0:05:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like Willis in America, as\Nwell as Mimi's friend Michael,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or any kid that saw Omnimon like Yoli\Ndid during our battle over the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, there could be\Nthousands of DigiDestined around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe we should\Nform some sort of union.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's answer all those\Nemails so we can find
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out just who has a\NDigiVice and who doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Tai, you write back kids in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, you take North and South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, you've got Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Joe, why don't you\Norder us some sandwiches?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always dreamed of an entire worldwide\Narmy of DigiDestined, And I'm the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother. Thank you, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That trade should really help the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now back to the emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Triceramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get my point?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you will if I use\Nmy trihorn attack on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't bother hitting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My shell is the hardest\Nof any Digimon alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon, you'd better digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all digivolved out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, Mummymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you he was smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warmer? Warmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burning up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for little old me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends aren't here to save you this\Ntime too bad cuz Triceramon looks hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to do something\Nabout that Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiball now, V-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are your champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon are their champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.50,0:08:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon,\NStarlight Champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,World Man, Digiball 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiball, the G-2 champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.50,0:08:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiking Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good little Digisaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:08:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you stomp on those\Nkids! Use your horns!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't listen to you, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not under the power\Nof the control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a real Digimon who just happens to\Nbe in the wrong place at the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.84,0:09:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the rest of\Nthose kids and why did only
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of them come to help\Ntheir miserable friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.38,0:09:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're probably on the internet trying\Nto sell off their trading card collections
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because the world is coming to an end\Nand there's nothing they can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's DNA Digivolve! You betcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-Beamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-Beamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivice, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon, get him into the Digi-Port!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oral-Kanemon, I know you haven't taken\Nmy affection for you seriously yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me prove my love for you by\Ndestroying Paildramon. Don't go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Mummymon. Oh, great. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake Bandits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.72,0:10:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the locations\Nwhere the digiports
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have opened and the digimon have appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more flashing lights\Nhere than a Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is find\Nsome way to send them all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back to the digital world\Nthrough those digiports.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one problem with that theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.50,0:10:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the digiports have closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we're gonna have\Nno choice but to go to each
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.50,0:10:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of those locations and use\Nthe D3s to open up new gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't Yoli's uncle a travel agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.72,0:11:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, but he's not a miracle worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.26,0:11:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can all travel\Nthrough the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one port at a time in each area\Nof the digital world can be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could take us months to\Ntravel all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have months.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way the control spires\Npop up, it's more like days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't find a way to destroy them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.72,0:11:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we won't have to worry about travel plans\Nbecause there'll be no place to travel to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things might get a little crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it kind of like when\Nyou first digivolved?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ever need me, just call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're real glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Gennai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you're a Gennai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last time we saw you, you were an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hat's off to your plastic surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would a ghost look this good to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're the most incredible hunk of\Nan incredibly old man I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chennai, our world's being attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in real trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.80,0:12:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's cool. What\Nis it? Listen close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was given to me by a Zoolong mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.52,0:12:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one of his 12 digicores.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of this sphere is unlike\Nanything you've seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.48,0:12:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if anyone's squeamish,\NI suggest you back out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, hold up your digivices.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I feel it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oop-a-bop, digivolve, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armageddon-a-bop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oop-a-bop. Digivolve, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oop-a-bop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They digivolved, in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisuke! Ken, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am drawn, Mega-Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial Drummond!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, guys, be honest, how do we look?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.44,0:14:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, uh, that\Nused to be Pyle Dramon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I have Digivolved to\Nthe highest level, my Mega form.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial Dramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am stronger than any other Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Mega Crusher attack\Nis virtually unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the strange monsters had a\Nstrange light hit him in a strange way,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which changed him into\Nanother strange monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is Imperial Dramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of Azulongmon's light\Nis stronger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pail Dramon used it to\Ndigivolve to his mega form.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:14:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genre, is that the same light that hit us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.54,0:15:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That light is one and the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means you should now be\Nable to digivolve to ultimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can let the cat out of the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, hit Digivolve to\NMega! That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't my day!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna need more bandages than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.58,0:15:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, CG port, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now we have to destroy\Nthe other control spires!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.68,0:15:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.62,0:15:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't travel that far without...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where the control spires are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to admit that's\Nrather impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.97,0:16:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while you're standing\Nthere drooling over your
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,new hero I'm going to\Ndevise a new plan of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Imperialdramon,\Nalong with Davis and Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I'm afraid this is too large\Nof a task for them to handle alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You each have jobs to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must work together or all will be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to you now, Imperialdramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.76,0:17:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's really been four years, what\Nhave you been doing all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been cleaning up\Nsome unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were very young at the time, Cody,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but do you remember when the digital\Nworld appeared in the sky above the Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, unfortunately, people\Nall over the world saw it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they also saw the final\Nbattle with Apocalymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,scientists and military\Naround the world have been
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to figure out a way\Nto get to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine if they were to succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.31,0:17:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people would want to travel there for a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vacation like it was the\NBahamas or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon there would be Digimon singing\NCalypso music and serving foo-foo drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.57,0:17:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've secretly begun\Nchanging all the data in the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,computers here on Earth to\Nkeep the digital world hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next up, Kyushu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said we.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean there are others\Nout there like you, Chennai?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.60,0:17:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:17:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only not as good-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My allies are positioned\Naround the world working with
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other Digidestined like\Nyou to stop this disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.26,0:18:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that takes care of all the\NDigimon who have appeared here in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's head back to Odaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Chennai, we all\Nunderstand we have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is point\Nus in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.86,0:18:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have picked six other\Nstrategic locations around
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.74,0:18:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the world where the Digimon\Nhave recently appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other Digidestined are\Nmeeting my allies in those spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those command posts are in New York,\NHong Kong, Moscow, Mexico City,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sydney, and Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look everybody, Ken\Nand Davis have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.76,0:18:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Digi-Ports won't open without a D3,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so Imperial Dramon will take each\Nof you to one of the six locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to join forces with the other\NDigidestined and lead them into battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't stop until all the\NDigimon have been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.04,0:19:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.06,0:19:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flying on Imperial Dramon\Nwas cool and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but do you think we can get a movie\Nand some of those headphone things?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial Dramon travels faster\Nthan the blink of an eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you won't have time\Nfor a movie, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my friends, good\Nluck on your journeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't leave us yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's got more important things\Nto do than hang around here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready? You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.66,0:19:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mom. You don't have\Nto worry about us, although I
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,may be gone a while I promise\Nto come back as soon as I can
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.82,0:19:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh what's that when I saw\Nall the reports on TV I knew
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd be leaving so I made you\Nsome rice balls for your trip
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:20:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mom. I really\Nappreciate it. I love you. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's too much static in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even get a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.48,0:20:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you face the\Nbiggest test of your lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's important\Ninformation you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're free to move about my cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when the fasten seatbelt light comes on,\Nplease return to your seats and buckle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we lose pressure during\Nthe flight, don't panic.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.34,0:20:43.09,jogress,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7F2E6&\fad(500,500)\pos(322,358)}2002/12/25, 11:40 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.70,0:20:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably just something I ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there go all our plans\Nfor destroying the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think my biorhythms\Nare really off today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going home and going straight to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your plans for a nap will have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.72,0:20:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got our new orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.23,0:21:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While they're out globetrotting,\NJapan is left defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.13,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.64,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.06,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.25,0:22:03.25,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:22:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.25,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.11,0:22:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you turn my head, you can't move again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.96,0:22:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time, every time, all are all there.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.26,0:22:17.18,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.18,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.30,0:22:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're alone, you're only one person.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.47,0:23:00.48,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\pos(320,315)}Great Melee in New York and Hong Kong!

